{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51531","headline":"留赠司空图（卢相携还朝，过陕虢，访图，深爱重，留诗曰：） · 卢携","name":"留赠司空图（卢相携还朝，过陕虢，访图，深爱重，留诗曰：）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"氏族司空贵，官班御史雄。\n老夫如且在，未可叹途穷。\n（《北梦锁言》三及《唐才子传》司空图下。\n《全唐诗》有此诗，与《纪事》同依据《南部新书》甲，多异文，故重录。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢携","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51531.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51531","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}